2. ZastTranslate (Dubbing Workflow Reference & Inspiration)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Architectural patterns, CPS-fitted length reformulations, and audio/video
mixing time-sync concepts are inspired by ZastTranslate:
  Repository: https://github.com/zast57/ZastTranslate
  Author: zast57

Per Architecture Decision Record ADR-0005, the Dub Engine in
`services/dub-engine` is a clean, independent implementation designed to
provide high-reliability loopback FastAPI endpoints, robust Windows
subtitles burn-in, and strict Khmer script integrity rules without
verbatim source copying. We gratefully acknowledge zast57 for pioneering
automated dubbing pipeline concepts.

