3. VoxCPM / VoxCPM2 (Multilingual Voice Cloning)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Zero-shot voice cloning architectures and model configurations are
derived from VoxCPM2:
  Repository: https://github.com/OpenBMB/VoxCPM
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Copyright (c) 2026 ModelBest Inc. & OpenBMB Contributors

Vishnu Creator utilizes VoxCPM2 weights and tokenization pipelines for
high-fidelity Khmer voice cloning, equipped with Nyquist-safe watermark
protection.

